title: "ADDLC: The Agentic Data Development Lifecycle - Specification"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-10"
authors:
  - family-names: Lukhnev
    given-names: Savva
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A vendor-neutral lifecycle for data teams working with AI agents:
  decision rights between humans, agents and controls; seven phases and
  four evidence-based gates; autonomy assigned per change class, earned
  with evidence and lost with escapes; segregation of Build and Run;
  a stewarded change channel for master and reference data; metrics and
  conformance levels.
